T OPENDOC texteditor-bigfile.txt
T OPEN Doc 1
T DIM File.Save 1
T DIM File.SaveAs 1
T DIM Edit.Cut 1
T DIM Edit.Copy 1
T DIM Edit.Paste 1
T DIM Edit.Clear 1
T FRONT Doc 1
T FIRE Doc.closeRequest
T CLOSE Doc 1
T DIM File.Save 0
T DIM File.SaveAs 0
T DIM Edit.Cut 0
T DIM Edit.Copy 0
T DIM Edit.Paste 0
T DIM Edit.Clear 0
T FIRE Doc.closed
